From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 03:40:22 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 22/48] avcodec/h2645_sei: export the 3D reference displays
 information on frames

Decode the 3D reference displays information of H.264 (H.13.2.4,
payloadType 51) and H.265 (G.14.3.3, payloadType 176) as frame side data
of the access units it applies to: until the next IDR access unit or
access unit with multiview acquisition information in H.264, and until
the next IRAP access unit in H.265. HEVC keeps exporting it as stream
side data from the extradata too.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5 via Claude Code
---
 libavcodec/h2645_sei.h           | 13 ++++-
 libavcodec/h2645_sei_multiview.c | 83 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 libavcodec/h264_slice.c          |  2 +
 libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c        | 12 +++--
 libavcodec/hevc/sei.c            | 11 ++++-
 5 files changed, 111 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

